---VIEWS---

--> View is an object in sql-server which is created and destroyed inside a database.
--> View is used to retrive the data from more than one data table.
--> It is a mirrorical representation of a data table.
--> It is virtual table.
--> It does not store any data, it is logical representation of the data table.
--> It is of two types : i) User Defined View ii) System Defined View
--> View is used for security purpose and it is used to faster interaction of data from the database.

--> Syntax
Create View view_name 
As
Statement